{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17098","headline":"奉陪武相公西亭夜宴陆郎中 · 崔备","name":"奉陪武相公西亭夜宴陆郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宾阁玳筵开，通宵递玉杯。\n尘随歌扇起，雪逐舞衣回。\n剪烛清光发，添香煖气来。\n令君敦宿好，更爲一裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}